8
00:00:39.165 --> 00:00:40.531
That gives two versions.

9
00:00:40.811 --> 00:00:45.547
The exact test computes the two-sided binomial tail probability directly.

10
00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:56.899
The familiar large-sample version uses the statistic (n_AB - n_BA)^2 / (n_AB + n_BA), compared with a chi-square distribution with one degree of freedom.

11
